OL,3,GNEWSATop-floor flat fire leaves
OL,4,Aresidents out of homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a block of flats
OL,7,Fremain out of their homes after a fire
OL,8,Fon the top floor spread early on Sunday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FFirefighters in seven fire engines were
OL,12,Fsent to Keel House, Dorchester Road,
OL,13,FWeymouth, shortly before 01:00 BST
OL,14,Fwhere crews found a "well-developed"
OL,15,Ffire within a flat had spread to the
OL,16,Froof.
OL,18,FDorset & Wiltshire Fire and Rescue said
OL,19,F30 firefighters worked to tackle the
OL,20,Ffire at its height. The building was
OL,21,Ffully evacuated and crews inside had to
OL,22,Fleave when the roof became unstable.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
