OL,3,GNEWSATop-floor flat fire leaves
OL,4,Aresidents out of homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service said it was working
OL,7,Fwith police to carry out a fire
OL,8,Finvestigation. Aster Group that manages
OL,9,Fthe building said its teams were
OL,10,Fsupporting residents "during this
OL,11,Fdifficult time".
